1
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,230
Today,

2
00:01:51,399 --> 00:01:53,160
Bofeng House proudly presents

3
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,479
Lady Situ's absolute favorite,

4
00:01:54,479 --> 00:01:56,039
"Spring Blossoms and Autumn Moon" pastries.

5
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,840
Crafted from seasonal blooms and fruits

6
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,119
over the course of a year,

7
00:01:59,119 --> 00:02:00,360
they are yours for just ten taels.

8
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:01,360
You can also enjoy

9
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:03,200
Lady Situ's signature brewed wine,

10
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,399
available for everyone to try.

11
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:07,560
Me! I'll have some!

12
00:02:21,919 --> 00:02:22,599
What is that,

13
00:02:22,599 --> 00:02:24,599
such a reeking stench of mutton?

14
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:26,039
It's been a while since I kicked you

15
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:27,120
out of the girls' academy, Wen.

16
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:29,359
You filthy little shepherd,

17
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,160
how come you end up here?

18
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,440
Hell, is Yan Fuzhi running

19
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,639
a proper wine house,

20
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:34,799
or a charity house?

21
00:02:34,799 --> 00:02:35,599
Exactly.

22
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:37,440
This place is going under sooner or later.

23
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,560
Grab her!

24
00:02:42,759 --> 00:02:44,400
Let me go! What are you doing?

25
00:02:44,599 --> 00:02:45,520
What do you want?

26
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:47,240
Let me go! Let go of me!

27
00:02:47,599 --> 00:02:48,759
Throughout the entire academy,

28
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,359
only Yan Fuzhi and Meng Tinghui

29
00:02:50,359 --> 00:02:51,359
dared to defy me.

30
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:53,520
Now that you're working for Yan Fuzhi,

31
00:02:53,799 --> 00:02:54,359
well,

32
00:02:54,359 --> 00:02:56,000
