33
00:02:56,039 --> 00:02:56,680
Mei'er,

34
00:02:57,359 --> 00:02:58,919
I'm just here doing odd jobs.

35
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:00,000
Please, I beg you...

36
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,319
Since when could you call me Mei'er?

37
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:11,160
This mutton stench is giving me a headache.

38
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:13,400
Give her a wash.

39
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,319
Let me go!

40
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:17,960
Let go of me!

41
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:22,720
Doesn't Yan Fuzhi have your back?

42
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:24,520
Let's see if

43
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,359
