44
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:27,960
No!

45
00:03:30,479 --> 00:03:32,440
Please, don't! I'm begging you!

46
00:03:36,199 --> 00:03:36,799
Stop right there!

47
00:03:39,639 --> 00:03:40,680
Please...

48
00:03:49,799 --> 00:03:50,400
Hurry, get out of here.

49
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:52,680
What did Wen

50
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:53,720
ever do to you

51
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,599
