52
00:03:56,639 --> 00:03:58,039
Look who's finally here.

53
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,319
I heard you hired

54
00:03:59,319 --> 00:04:00,319
some girl named Situ Xue,

55
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:02,120
who's been stealing the spotlight.

56
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:03,440
Go ahead and fetch her.

57
00:04:03,799 --> 00:04:05,479
I refuse to believe that here in Shazhou

58
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:07,720
