59
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,599
Get lost!

60
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:14,280
Smash the place to pieces!

61
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,160
Song.

62
00:04:17,039 --> 00:04:18,039
If you dare lay a finger,

63
00:04:18,079 --> 00:04:19,240
you can kiss our families'

64
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,520
silk business goodbye.

65
00:04:21,359 --> 00:04:21,879
Mei'er.

66
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:23,239
Wen might have no power or status,

67
00:04:23,439 --> 00:04:23,820
but the Yans are wealthy

68
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:24,679
- and well-connected.
- Stop!

69
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:25,239
In Shazhou,

70
00:04:25,239 --> 00:04:26,439
they carry serious weight.

71
00:04:27,039 --> 00:04:28,599
My uncle is the Provincial Governor,

72
00:04:28,599 --> 00:04:30,039
backed by the Grand Chancellor himself.

73
00:04:30,599 --> 00:04:30,919
If you

74
00:04:30,919 --> 00:04:31,999
don't have the guts for even this,

75
00:04:32,119 --> 00:04:33,400
crawl back to your silk shop

76
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:34,559
