77
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:36,479
Move!

78
00:04:36,479 --> 00:04:38,080
Stop! Let her go!

79
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:39,400
Do it.

80
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,439
I want this place gone.

81
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,679
Stop!

82
00:04:51,679 --> 00:04:52,359
My face!

83
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,320
Let go!

84
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:54,599
Blood!

85
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,200
My face!

86
00:04:56,599 --> 00:04:57,359
Let go of me!

87
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,760
You struck me?

88
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:02,479
Are you tired of living?

89
00:05:02,679 --> 00:05:04,239
Where's that precious confidante of yours?

90
00:05:04,359 --> 00:05:05,919
Why isn't she here to save you?

91
00:05:07,239 --> 00:05:08,840
If I don't see Situ Xue today,

92
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,479
I'll turn this place

93
00:05:10,479 --> 00:05:11,640
into rubble.

94
00:05:12,919 --> 00:05:13,479
Stop right there!

95
00:05:14,479 --> 00:05:15,679
You wanted to see me? Here I am.

96
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:16,479
Release her.

97
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:22,080
Miss!

98
00:05:45,559 --> 00:05:46,840
When did you get back?

99
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:48,119
This is none of your concern.

100
00:05:48,119 --> 00:05:48,720
There's

101
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,039
