102
00:06:27,119 --> 00:06:28,119
Meng Tinghui!

103
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:29,520
It's you?

104
00:06:30,359 --> 00:06:31,919
A lowly orphan like you

105
00:06:31,919 --> 00:06:33,840
masquerading as the finest dancer from capital?

106
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:34,439
Jiang Mei'er.

107
00:06:34,919 --> 00:06:36,160
I'll give you a chance to fix this.

108
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:38,039
Get on your knees and confess.

109
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:39,599
Pay double for the damages.

110
00:06:39,919 --> 00:06:40,760
Otherwise,

111
00:06:46,479 --> 00:06:48,080
