122
00:07:19,239 --> 00:07:20,119
I'd call that a bargain.

123
00:07:21,799 --> 00:07:22,559
Jiang Mei'er.

124
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,280
You wanted the House

125
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,320
