126
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:26,919
Let me help you.

127
00:07:27,200 --> 00:07:29,720
One spark, and we all burn together.

128
00:07:35,559 --> 00:07:36,599
Meng Tinghui, you lunatic!

129
00:07:36,599 --> 00:07:37,880
Scared now?

130
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:40,359
But you seemed to enjoy yourself

131
00:07:40,479 --> 00:07:41,679
when tormenting others.

132
00:07:42,119 --> 00:07:43,479
Meng Tinghui, this is too much!

133
00:07:44,239 --> 00:07:45,200
Mr. Song.

134
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:47,999
How chivalric to offer to die alongside them.

135
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:49,919
I'll gladly oblige.

136
00:07:51,599 --> 00:07:52,119
Mei'er,

137
00:07:52,119 --> 00:07:53,080
she's been a lying crook

138
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:53,760
since we were kids.

139
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:55,200
We can't risk our lives over her!

140
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,439
You useless coward!

141
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:59,280
My patience is wearing thin.

142
00:07:59,439 --> 00:08:01,640
If you don't do as I said,

143
00:08:03,119 --> 00:08:04,359
then we all burn.

144
00:08:06,999 --> 00:08:08,119
M-Meng Tinghui, I'm sorry!

145
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:08,919
I'll pay!

146
00:08:09,119 --> 00:08:09,679
Coward!

147
00:08:09,679 --> 00:08:10,400
Fuzhi.

148
00:08:10,599 --> 00:08:11,400
Collect the silver.

149
00:08:14,359 --> 00:08:15,200
Mr. Song.

150
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:16,479
Who is prettier,

151
00:08:16,479 --> 00:08:17,599
