152
00:08:17,999 --> 00:08:19,119
You! No doubt.

153
00:08:19,479 --> 00:08:20,679
And what does she look like?

154
00:08:21,119 --> 00:08:22,359
She is hideous.

155
00:08:22,359 --> 00:08:23,559
A toad! A dung beetle!

156
00:08:23,599 --> 00:08:24,400
She drools!

157
00:08:25,679 --> 00:08:27,400
You... you worthless piece of trash!

158
00:08:31,039 --> 00:08:33,080
Meng Tinghui... Yan Fuzhi...

159
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,720
I... I'm sorry!

160
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:37,080
She... she forced me into all of it!

161
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:40,360
She scalded me with boiling water once too!

162
00:08:41,719 --> 00:08:43,400
You two are damn useless!

163
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,439
Meng Tinghui!

164
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:46,919
I'll kill you!

165
00:08:59,319 --> 00:09:00,160
I'm sorry.

166
00:09:00,319 --> 00:09:02,280
Meng Tinghui, I was wrong!

167
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:04,679
I'll pay you too!

168
00:09:04,839 --> 00:09:06,480
Take off all your jewelry.

169
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,199
Fine.

170
00:09:11,799 --> 00:09:13,600
Here. Move, help me take them off!

171
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,480
Are we good?

172
00:09:28,799 --> 00:09:30,120
Kowtow and apologize.

173
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:32,000
Move.

174
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,760
That  was far too light.

175
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:41,640
I didn't hear a thing.

176
00:09:58,039 --> 00:10:00,480
I've done everything you asked.

177
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:04,120
Can we leave now?

178
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,799
They look dirty and wretched.

179
00:10:15,799 --> 00:10:16,880
Absolutely pathetic.

180
00:10:17,439 --> 00:10:18,319
What are you staring at?

181
00:10:18,520 --> 00:10:19,640
There's nothing to see here!

182
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:22,240
Move! Walk in front!

183
00:10:24,079 --> 00:10:25,120
Out of my way!

184
00:10:35,839 --> 00:10:37,039
One hundred and twenty.

185
00:10:37,919 --> 00:10:38,959
Forty.

186
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,199
Twenty.

187
00:10:45,039 --> 00:10:45,559
Ten.

188
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:47,439
Ten.

189
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:50,799
Tinghui.

190
00:10:51,199 --> 00:10:52,439
Over three hundred taels.

191
00:10:53,439 --> 00:10:54,880
Besides treating Wen's injuries,

192
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:55,839
it suffices

193
00:10:55,839 --> 00:10:56,959
to renovate Bofeng House.

194
00:10:57,319 --> 00:10:58,240
These parasites.

195
00:10:58,480 --> 00:10:59,360
Who knows how much they've

196
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,280
squeezed out of the people.

197
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,640
They had it coming.

198
00:11:02,919 --> 00:11:04,280
Call it robbing the rich to feed the poor.

199
00:11:05,559 --> 00:11:06,679
Fuzhi, just bring the money

200
00:11:06,679 --> 00:11:07,919
to Wen tonight,

201
00:11:08,079 --> 00:11:09,120
for her timely treatment.

202
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:10,039
Alright.

203
00:11:11,799 --> 00:11:12,640
But, Tinghui.

204
00:11:12,839 --> 00:11:14,120
You scared me to death back there.

205
00:11:14,319 --> 00:11:15,199
What if...

206
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:18,959
It was fake.

207
00:11:19,319 --> 00:11:20,559
This special phosphor powder

208
00:11:20,559 --> 00:11:21,679
was originally meant

209
00:11:21,679 --> 00:11:22,719
for Situ Xue's performance.

210
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,199
It came in handy.

211
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,000
Tinghui.

212
00:11:27,959 --> 00:11:29,039
I'm so sorry.

213
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,600
I got you dragged into all of this.

214
00:11:31,199 --> 00:11:33,160
Shazhou is a place that devours people whole.

215
00:11:33,319 --> 00:11:35,199
The only way out is through the imperial exam.

216
00:11:35,559 --> 00:11:36,559
Besides,

217
00:11:36,559 --> 00:11:38,400
Jiang Mei'er won't let this slide.

218
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:40,880
The place could get trashed,

219
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,959
but what if they messed up your Provincial Exam?

220
00:11:42,959 --> 00:11:44,280
I study to become an official

221
00:11:45,919 --> 00:11:46,799
precisely so I can

222
00:11:46,799 --> 00:11:47,959
protect the people I care about.

223
00:11:48,719 --> 00:11:49,760
Ten years ago,

224
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:52,160
I couldn't protect Xiang.

225
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:55,880
If I fail to protect you today,

226
00:11:56,520 --> 00:11:57,400
what's the point of

227
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,079
officialdom at all?

228
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:01,760
Sweet, sweet Tinghui.

229
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:03,240
If only you were a boy.

230
00:12:05,199 --> 00:12:06,799
I'd definitely marry you.

231
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,079
Fuzhi.

232
00:12:15,679 --> 00:12:16,799
Not so tight, sweetie.

233
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,880
I can't breathe.

234
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:19,640
No.

235
00:12:19,799 --> 00:12:21,000
I'm not letting go

236
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:23,000
for the rest of my life.

237
00:12:23,959 --> 00:12:25,039
You, sweetie, will

238
00:12:25,559 --> 00:12:27,480
soar to the highest heavens.

239
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:30,760
And then we'll go to Jingdu together.

240
00:12:31,959 --> 00:12:33,240
The two of us in Jingdu, together.

241
00:12:38,679 --> 00:12:39,400
Fuzhi?

242
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:41,079
If not for Jiang Mei'er,

243
00:12:41,079 --> 00:12:42,000
I was supposed to be telling you...

244
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:42,520
that I made

245
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:44,000
Apricot peel cake, your favorite.

246
00:12:50,520 --> 00:12:51,160
Xiang used to

247
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:52,640
love this more than anything.

248
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,520
In a few more days,

249
00:13:00,799 --> 00:13:02,760
it'll be the anniversary of her passing.

250
00:13:05,640 --> 00:13:06,439
When the day comes,

251
00:13:07,439 --> 00:13:08,520
we'll visit her together.

252
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:31,160
Lock the doors, close the windows.

253
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:34,679
Guard against thieves and bandits.

254
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:40,959
Lock the doors, close the windows.

255
00:13:41,760 --> 00:13:44,559
Guard against thieves and bandits.

256
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,799
Let go! Let go of me!

257
00:13:55,280 --> 00:13:56,600
Let me go!

258
00:13:56,839 --> 00:13:58,839
Let me go!

259
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:01,760
Let me go! Let go!

260
00:14:02,199 --> 00:14:03,160
Let go!

261
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:06,360
Let me go! Let go!

262
00:14:06,719 --> 00:14:08,199
Let me go!

263
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:13,919
Xiang!

264
00:14:48,679 --> 00:14:49,799
Fancy running into you again.

265
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:51,120
Miss Meng.

266
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,160
You really are

267
00:14:58,160 --> 00:15:00,319
a cunning little swindler.

268
00:15:02,319 --> 00:15:03,719
I was only protecting myself.

269
00:15:05,039 --> 00:15:06,679
You hold quite the grudge, sir.

270
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:08,360
By making such a grand show of it

271
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:09,719
over a pushover like me,

272
00:15:09,799 --> 00:15:11,280
you're just undermining yourself.

273
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:12,559
"A pushover"?

274
00:15:14,520 --> 00:15:15,120
Sir.

275
00:15:15,719 --> 00:15:16,600
You've seen her now.

276
00:15:17,039 --> 00:15:18,360
The Grand Chancellor requested that

277
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:19,640
we return to the capital tonight.

278
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:21,799
Wait for me outside.

279
00:15:22,280 --> 00:15:23,000
Sir,

280
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:23,640
it's getting late...

281
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:24,319
Out.

282
00:15:38,640 --> 00:15:39,640
Keep a sharp eye.

283
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:42,039
We must escort him back tonight, no matter what.

284
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:42,799
Yes.

285
00:15:47,679 --> 00:15:49,079
I hold a grudge?

286
00:15:49,280 --> 00:15:50,679
If Huo An hadn't been my man,

287
00:15:50,679 --> 00:15:52,079
I'd be dead by now.

288
00:15:52,679 --> 00:15:53,959
You're so used to betrayal,

289
00:15:53,959 --> 00:15:54,799
always scheming.

290
00:15:54,799 --> 00:15:56,000
Even if you become an official,

291
00:15:56,640 --> 00:15:58,760
you'd likely be a treacherous one.

292
00:16:02,199 --> 00:16:03,679
What about you, Mr. clout?

293
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:05,959
You let the Black Tiger Gang and Ding Chong off,

294
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,760
and chose to bark up the wrong tree.

295
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:09,360
How impressive.

296
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:11,120
You tricked me.

297
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:13,199
That's a death sentence.

298
00:16:21,199 --> 00:16:22,160
Why do I keep

299
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:23,719
running into you, wretched jinx?

300
00:16:24,199 --> 00:16:25,199
- You want to leave, fine.
- Upwards.

301
00:16:25,199 --> 00:16:26,480
Can't you use the front door?

302
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,120
You better pay for the broken doors.

303
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,439
I got a business to run. You hear me?

304
00:16:30,039 --> 00:16:30,480
Fine.

305
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:32,120
Once you leave, don't ever come back.

306
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,360
Get out of my sight for good.

307
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:34,520
You shameless prick.

308
00:16:34,799 --> 00:16:35,760
Absolutely jinxed.

309
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:37,400
Get lost, shameless bastard!

310
00:16:37,679 --> 00:16:38,199
After him!

311
00:16:56,319 --> 00:16:58,079
I never knew Miss Meng had such a tongue.

312
00:16:58,640 --> 00:16:59,439
Did you enjoy it?

313
00:17:01,439 --> 00:17:02,959
To help you slip away,

314
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:04,640
I had to put my heart into it.

315
00:17:04,679 --> 00:17:05,559
Just to be convincing.

316
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:11,640
Now we are even.

317
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:14,040
Are we ever going to be?

318
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:17,719
I'm thirsty. Bring tea.

319
00:17:20,999 --> 00:17:23,199
Says someone who's just chased down?

320
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,160
Ding Chong preys on the people and commits

321
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:32,320
every evil imaginable.

322
00:17:32,719 --> 00:17:33,400
Why don't you folks

323
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:34,640
appeal directly to the throne?

324
00:17:41,239 --> 00:17:42,519
That's easy for you to say.

325
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:45,919
Without a travel permit from Ding in Shazhou,

326
00:17:46,519 --> 00:17:47,439
I doubt even a fly

327
00:17:47,439 --> 00:17:48,479
could fly out of here.

328
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:50,160
Those who try to sneak off to appeal

329
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:51,519
end up killed halfway.

330
00:17:51,959 --> 00:17:53,679
Sadly, His Majesty sits high in the grand palace,

331
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:55,880
where songs of praise drown out

332
00:17:56,519 --> 00:17:58,279
the wail of the common folk.

333
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:05,279
The Grand Chancellor arrogates all powers to himself.

334
00:18:05,959 --> 00:18:08,199
Everything the emperor sees and hears is carefully filtered.

335
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:10,320
It's not that His Majesty is deaf to the people's cry.

336
00:18:10,679 --> 00:18:12,360
It's just that someone's been hiding the truth.

337
00:18:12,640 --> 00:18:13,479
His Majesty

338
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,239
is also trapped with his hands tied.

339
00:18:18,279 --> 00:18:20,120
The chancellors' factions are deeply entrenched,

340
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:21,759
rife with empty rhetoric of rites and virtue.

341
00:18:22,800 --> 00:18:23,959
They must despise the thought

342
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:24,880
of women taking office.

343
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:26,160
Yet His Majesty

344
00:18:26,519 --> 00:18:28,040
is determined to use women as a sharp blade,

345
00:18:28,120 --> 00:18:30,270
just to shatter this corrupt and rotten system.

346
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:31,199
From now on,

347
00:18:31,919 --> 00:18:33,360
he shall look among the common and

348
00:18:33,479 --> 00:18:34,600
carry out institutional reforms.

349
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,239
If you make the Presented Scholar list,

350
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,560
would you dare to stand in court

351
00:18:38,560 --> 00:18:39,999
and call the Chancellor a pedantic fool?

352
00:18:40,519 --> 00:18:41,679
I'd do more than just curse him.

353
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,800
Shadow thrives, because

354
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:46,910
someone in the court is extending a canopy over it.

355
00:18:47,719 --> 00:18:48,840
One day,

356
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:50,759
when I set foot in the Golden Hall,

357
00:18:51,320 --> 00:18:53,239
I will burn this canopy with my own hands.

358
00:18:53,999 --> 00:18:55,479
You haven't even entered officialdom,

359
00:18:55,959 --> 00:18:57,800
yet you're speaking boldly of state affairs.

360
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:01,239
Focus on your Provincial Exam.

361
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:02,560
Till we meet again.

362
00:19:06,519 --> 00:19:07,719
Don't count on it.

363
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:16,300
[Didn't strike me as a throne room official.]

364
00:19:55,840 --> 00:19:56,600
Your Majesty.

365
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:58,880
You've been in seclusion for five days,

366
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:01,160
eating only one vegetarian meal a day.

367
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:03,120
This old servant is truly

368
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:04,759
worried about your health.

369
00:20:05,239 --> 00:20:07,439
Please, you must have proper meals.

370
00:20:07,439 --> 00:20:09,600
The Grand Chancellor is here.

371
00:20:18,239 --> 00:20:19,080
Grand Chancellor.

372
00:20:23,999 --> 00:20:24,759
Grand Chancellor.

373
00:20:25,239 --> 00:20:26,320
You must not!

374
00:20:26,519 --> 00:20:27,320
Without His Majesty's

375
00:20:27,320 --> 00:20:28,320
imperial decree,

376
00:20:28,320 --> 00:20:29,759
no one is to enter the Sacred Ancestral Hall.

377
00:20:35,439 --> 00:20:35,999
Are you...

378
00:20:36,160 --> 00:20:36,999
Grand Chancellor.

379
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:39,040
Don't make things difficult for me!

380
00:20:39,439 --> 00:20:40,120
Out of my way!

381
00:20:51,040 --> 00:20:51,679
Close the door.

382
00:21:10,999 --> 00:21:12,120
Grand Chancellor.

383
00:21:13,959 --> 00:21:15,199
Still up at this late hour?

384
00:21:15,679 --> 00:21:16,719
Aren't you going to rest?

385
00:21:16,999 --> 00:21:18,360
Did you bring me

386
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:19,640
a chicken leg again?

387
00:21:20,199 --> 00:21:21,080
I'm... I'm

388
00:21:21,800 --> 00:21:23,519
starving to death here.

389
00:21:25,439 --> 00:21:26,199
Ridiculous.

390
00:21:27,080 --> 00:21:29,439
His Majesty has been running wild in Shazhou.

391
00:21:29,919 --> 00:21:31,719
Set off for Shazhou immediately.

392
00:21:32,439 --> 00:21:35,239
Bring His Majesty back within five days.

393
00:21:35,239 --> 00:21:36,199
Grand Chancellor,

394
00:21:36,800 --> 00:21:38,120
the journey to Shazhou alone

395
00:21:39,239 --> 00:21:40,919
takes more than five days.

396
00:21:42,040 --> 00:21:43,400
Take my chancellor's token.

397
00:21:43,439 --> 00:21:44,479
Travel day and night.

398
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:46,040
At every relay station along the way,

399
00:21:46,120 --> 00:21:47,600
swift horses will be prepared for you.

400
00:21:48,199 --> 00:21:49,199
Five days?

401
00:21:49,919 --> 00:21:50,600
I...

402
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:56,959
You impersonated His Majesty.

403
00:21:57,880 --> 00:21:59,239
It's an unforgivable crime.

404
00:21:59,759 --> 00:22:01,120
You should've been executed at once!

405
00:22:01,120 --> 00:22:01,759
Five days!

406
00:22:02,640 --> 00:22:03,519
It's a deal.

407
00:22:10,959 --> 00:22:11,640
Your Majesty.

408
00:22:11,880 --> 00:22:12,759
Sorry for being late.

409
00:22:13,519 --> 00:22:14,479
Any findings in the army?

410
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:16,510
There are ten battalions

411
00:22:16,519 --> 00:22:17,439
stationed in Shazhou now,

412
00:22:17,719 --> 00:22:18,919
but the camps are all crumbling,

413
00:22:18,919 --> 00:22:19,840
wanting repair.

414
00:22:20,439 --> 00:22:22,120
Rust armor, spears, and shields are

415
00:22:22,120 --> 00:22:22,999
beyond counting.

416
00:22:23,199 --> 00:22:24,519
The silver taels allocated by the court

417
00:22:24,959 --> 00:22:25,759
were never spent

418
00:22:25,759 --> 00:22:26,600
on military supplies.

419
00:22:29,959 --> 00:22:32,120
"Strategic stronghold" is too convenient an excuse

420
00:22:32,439 --> 00:22:34,439
for making exorbitant demands on the court

421
00:22:34,439 --> 00:22:36,320
for grain and military pay.

422
00:22:37,239 --> 00:22:39,080
Xu Ting indulges them without restraint,

423
00:22:39,120 --> 00:22:40,360
giving them whatever they ask.

424
00:22:40,959 --> 00:22:41,800
And yet, as before,

425
00:22:41,800 --> 00:22:43,040
the troops are stale, the horses frail.

426
00:22:43,640 --> 00:22:45,360
When one man is corrupt at court,

427
00:22:45,959 --> 00:22:47,999
the whole nation rots beneath him.

428
00:22:48,560 --> 00:22:49,400
Your Majesty,

429
00:22:50,080 --> 00:22:51,120
minus the final leg back to the palace,

430
00:22:51,120 --> 00:22:51,840
we have two days left.

431
00:22:52,479 --> 00:22:53,600
What do we do next?

432
00:22:54,919 --> 00:22:56,560
Ding Chong and the Ministry of War are in cahoots.

433
00:22:56,759 --> 00:22:58,320
They're all Xu Ting's lackeys.

434
00:22:59,160 --> 00:23:00,479
I want to see

435
00:23:01,479 --> 00:23:03,320
beneath the yellow sand of Shazhou

436
00:23:03,759 --> 00:23:05,959
just how many dirty secrets are buried.

437
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:17,640
Here you go, miss.

438
00:23:17,999 --> 00:23:18,400
Thanks.

439
00:23:18,719 --> 00:23:19,640
Take your time.

440
00:23:19,800 --> 00:23:20,400
Sure.

441
00:23:21,959 --> 00:23:22,959
Upper-floor wing room 1.

442
00:23:24,360 --> 00:23:26,400
Gentlemen, here's your wine!

443
00:23:26,880 --> 00:23:27,560
Enjoy.

444
00:23:27,759 --> 00:23:28,320
Cheers.

445
00:23:28,719 --> 00:23:29,360
Come on, bottoms up!

446
00:23:29,840 --> 00:23:30,479
Tinghui!

447
00:23:31,199 --> 00:23:31,800
Tinghui!

448
00:23:31,999 --> 00:23:33,160
Look at how lively it is!

449
00:23:33,160 --> 00:23:33,840
I was worried

450
00:23:33,840 --> 00:23:35,120
after Jiang Mei'er's drama,

451
00:23:35,120 --> 00:23:36,239
business'd be slack for a while.

452
00:23:36,239 --> 00:23:36,880
But guess what?

453
00:23:36,880 --> 00:23:38,320
We're seeing more jam-packed days.

454
00:23:38,640 --> 00:23:39,880
Now your stepmother can give up

455
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:40,880
goading your father into

456
00:23:40,880 --> 00:23:41,640
marrying you off, huh?

457
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:42,479
Of course.

458
00:23:42,640 --> 00:23:44,279
I'll rub it in their faces that

459
00:23:44,279 --> 00:23:46,080
women are far beyond wives and mothers.

460
00:23:46,080 --> 00:23:46,840
We can thrive

461
00:23:46,840 --> 00:23:48,120
in business and rise to the top.

462
00:23:48,199 --> 00:23:49,400
We're made by ourselves.

463
00:23:49,679 --> 00:23:50,919
Well said, lady.

464
00:23:51,959 --> 00:23:53,360
I'm so glad

465
00:23:53,360 --> 00:23:54,239
you're thriving.

466
00:23:54,719 --> 00:23:56,160
I'm hurrying back to the academy now.

467
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:57,199
The Provincial Exam's nigh.

468
00:23:57,199 --> 00:23:57,679
Right.

469
00:23:57,679 --> 00:23:58,999
Tinghui, you just focus on your exam.

470
00:23:58,999 --> 00:24:00,320
We'll go to Jingdu together.

471
00:24:00,320 --> 00:24:01,800
You will top the exam,

472
00:24:01,800 --> 00:24:02,800
and I'll open a new branch.

473
00:24:02,800 --> 00:24:03,719
We'll make both happen.

474
00:24:03,719 --> 00:24:04,360
It's a deal.

475
00:24:05,279 --> 00:24:05,919
I'll see you out.

476
00:24:12,439 --> 00:24:12,919
To what

477
00:24:12,919 --> 00:24:14,120
do we owe the honor, gentlemen?

478
00:24:14,120 --> 00:24:15,840
Private seats are upstairs. This way, please.

479
00:24:17,199 --> 00:24:18,519
By order of Governor Ding,

480
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:20,519
Bofeng House serves unsanitary food

481
00:24:20,600 --> 00:24:21,560
and is in disrepair.

482
00:24:21,840 --> 00:24:23,439
Effective immediately, it is to be sealed.

483
00:24:23,719 --> 00:24:24,360
Nonsense!

484
00:24:24,360 --> 00:24:26,040
We just had this place renovated recently,

485
00:24:26,040 --> 00:24:27,719
and I personally oversee all the food and drink.

486
00:24:27,719 --> 00:24:28,400
Insolence!

487
00:24:28,999 --> 00:24:30,759
The authorities have received complaints.

488
00:24:30,840 --> 00:24:32,080
You're in no position to argue!

489
00:24:32,279 --> 00:24:34,080
Clear out, all of you!

490
00:24:36,840 --> 00:24:37,479
Fuzhi!

491
00:24:37,959 --> 00:24:39,120
It's about Jiang Mei'er.

492
00:24:39,120 --> 00:24:40,040
They won't let us off.

493
00:24:40,240 --> 00:24:41,780
We can't win against official seals and red stamps.

494
00:24:41,840 --> 00:24:43,230
Who's in charge here?

495
00:24:43,479 --> 00:24:44,400
You need to take the exam.

496
00:24:44,679 --> 00:24:45,199
Me.

497
00:24:45,919 --> 00:24:46,959
I'm looking for Meng Tinghui.

498
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:48,600
I am Meng Tinghui.

499
00:24:48,719 --> 00:24:50,999
You impersonated Situ Xue to swindle the people,

500
00:24:51,120 --> 00:24:52,439
amassing wealth illegally.

501
00:24:52,600 --> 00:24:53,600
By Governor Ding's order,

502
00:24:53,759 --> 00:24:54,880
you're to be taken to prison.

503
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:56,600
Your writ only says to seal the property,

504
00:24:56,800 --> 00:24:57,640
not to arrest anyone.

505
00:24:57,679 --> 00:24:58,439
People of Shazhou

506
00:24:58,439 --> 00:24:59,519
are all watching outside.

507
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:00,759
Enough talk.

508
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:04,880
I'll go with you.

509
00:25:04,880 --> 00:25:06,040
Bofeng House is mine.

510
00:25:06,040 --> 00:25:06,999
She wasn't involved.

511
00:25:06,999 --> 00:25:08,600
She's sitting for the imperial exam in just a few days.

512
00:25:08,600 --> 00:25:10,679
She's just forfeit the right to take it.

513
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:11,439
Take her away!

514
00:25:12,519 --> 00:25:13,040
Tinghui!

515
00:25:15,519 --> 00:25:16,120
Tinghui!

516
00:25:16,840 --> 00:25:17,479
Tinghui!

517
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:19,160
How could they just arrest her like that?

518
00:25:19,560 --> 00:25:20,519
Will we still be able to

519
00:25:20,519 --> 00:25:21,519
come and dine here, Tinghui?

520
00:25:28,679 --> 00:25:29,640
This way, sirs.

521
00:25:34,239 --> 00:25:35,320
That beast Ding Chong!

522
00:25:35,679 --> 00:25:37,400
Shazhou's drought-plagued. Water is treasured like gold.

523
00:25:37,479 --> 00:25:38,360
For a sip of water,

524
00:25:38,360 --> 00:25:39,439
folks'd sell their own children.

525
00:25:39,600 --> 00:25:40,640
Now he squanders it like this!

526
00:25:41,519 --> 00:25:42,320
What's that, sirs?

527
00:25:42,560 --> 00:25:43,400
What are you saying?

528
00:25:45,519 --> 00:25:46,439
It's just...

529
00:25:46,840 --> 00:25:48,600
all this imperial Nanmu wood in your residence

530
00:25:48,759 --> 00:25:49,840
would be hard to find

531
00:25:49,840 --> 00:25:50,800
even in the palace.

532
00:25:51,160 --> 00:25:52,080
The Governor says

533
00:25:52,279 --> 00:25:53,719
if His Majesty has fine things,

534
00:25:53,959 --> 00:25:55,080
we've got to have even finer.

535
00:25:56,479 --> 00:25:57,199
Please, sirs.

536
00:26:00,199 --> 00:26:00,999
Sir,

537
00:26:01,320 --> 00:26:02,719
let me kill him right now!

538
00:27:19,080 --> 00:27:19,679
Excellent!

539
00:27:20,239 --> 00:27:21,800
The best performance of the day!

540
00:27:22,279 --> 00:27:23,279
I'm very pleased.

541
00:27:23,560 --> 00:27:24,719
Everyone gets a reward!

542
00:27:27,600 --> 00:27:29,719
Mr. Hal of North Jian has arrived.

543
00:27:36,360 --> 00:27:37,239
I am Hal,

544
00:27:37,719 --> 00:27:39,679
representing one of the biggest trade names in my country.

545
00:27:40,320 --> 00:27:41,600
I'm new to Shazhou for business.

546
00:27:41,719 --> 00:27:43,400
They say the Governor is all-powerful,

547
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:45,640
so I came to pay my respects.

548
00:27:55,959 --> 00:27:56,719
Doesn't look like it.

549
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:07,679
Mr. Hal, this godforsaken place

550
00:28:07,679 --> 00:28:09,840
has nothing but sand.

551
00:28:10,160 --> 00:28:12,959
What business could you possibly have?

552
00:28:15,040 --> 00:28:16,360
Drought or no drought,

553
00:28:16,759 --> 00:28:18,600
it's all the Dragon King's call.

554
00:28:19,040 --> 00:28:20,080
In Shazhou,

555
00:28:20,279 --> 00:28:21,479
isn't Governor Ding

556
00:28:21,479 --> 00:28:23,360
the very Dragon King who controls the elements?

557
00:28:26,360 --> 00:28:28,880
That's a grand gesture.

558
00:28:29,279 --> 00:28:29,880
Spill it.

559
00:28:30,279 --> 00:28:31,279
What kind of business are you in?

560
00:28:31,719 --> 00:28:32,959
I tend to dabble in

561
00:28:33,360 --> 00:28:34,679
what most shy away from.

562
00:28:35,800 --> 00:28:36,840
To be frank, Governor Ding,

563
00:28:38,040 --> 00:28:40,199
I deal in goods the court has banned.

564
00:28:41,400 --> 00:28:42,959
I love doing business

565
00:28:42,959 --> 00:28:45,080
with those who have guts.

566
00:28:45,959 --> 00:28:46,840
However,

567
00:28:47,120 --> 00:28:48,160
Shazhou...

568
00:28:48,600 --> 00:28:50,120
has its own rules.

569
00:28:50,120 --> 00:28:51,199
And here come the rules.

570
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:05,600
Mr. Hal

571
00:29:05,600 --> 00:29:07,320
really knows how to play the game.

572
00:29:08,040 --> 00:29:09,199
Then I wonder, Governor,

573
00:29:09,439 --> 00:29:11,320
is this business of mine in Nethereach

574
00:29:11,439 --> 00:29:12,479
safe and sound?

575
00:29:15,360 --> 00:29:17,040
On this turf of Shazhou,

576
00:29:17,040 --> 00:29:18,880
even if Hades wants to claim a soul,

577
00:29:19,120 --> 00:29:21,560
he has to pay me the toll.

578
00:29:23,320 --> 00:29:23,759
Look.

579
00:29:26,160 --> 00:29:28,840
Bestowed by the Grand Chancellor himself.

580
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:32,479
"A Capable Minister for Governing the Realm."

581
00:29:34,919 --> 00:29:37,080
These days, even His Majesty has to

582
00:29:37,080 --> 00:29:38,479
heed the Grand Chancellor's words.

583
00:29:38,840 --> 00:29:40,080
With him backing me up,

584
00:29:40,239 --> 00:29:41,439
here in Shazhou,

585
00:29:41,679 --> 00:29:43,360
I am the heavens above!

586
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:45,080
So the Governor

587
00:29:45,080 --> 00:29:47,080
is the Grand Chancellor's favored man.

588
00:29:47,919 --> 00:29:49,439
Then why settle for Shazhou?

589
00:29:50,400 --> 00:29:51,959
With the Grand Chancellor's influence,

590
00:29:52,360 --> 00:29:54,679
he could well secure you a court position,

591
00:29:54,679 --> 00:29:56,239
couldn't he?

592
00:29:56,279 --> 00:29:57,519
Promotion, you mean?

593
00:29:58,800 --> 00:29:59,519
That's all just

594
00:29:59,519 --> 00:30:01,080
gobbledygook.

595
00:30:01,400 --> 00:30:02,600
Nothing beats a life here.

596
00:30:03,320 --> 00:30:05,199
Far from the madding court.

597
00:30:05,439 --> 00:30:06,519
In Jingdu,

598
00:30:06,640 --> 00:30:08,519
I'd have to kowtow to His Majesty.

599
00:30:08,600 --> 00:30:09,519
In Shazhou,

600
00:30:09,800 --> 00:30:13,360
everyone does that to me!

601
00:30:17,160 --> 00:30:19,120
What a life, indeed!

602
00:30:19,360 --> 00:30:21,360
You've opened my eyes.

603
00:30:21,959 --> 00:30:23,439
Well, my business deal...

604
00:30:23,479 --> 00:30:24,880
Uncle!

605
00:30:25,279 --> 00:30:26,560
Uncle!

606
00:30:27,080 --> 00:30:28,360
- Uncle!
- Brother!

607
00:30:28,360 --> 00:30:28,999
Uncle!

608
00:30:28,999 --> 00:30:29,840
That madwoman Meng Tinghui,

609
00:30:29,840 --> 00:30:31,120
has she been caught yet?

610
00:30:31,400 --> 00:30:32,959
Can't you see I'm with a guest here?

611
00:30:33,640 --> 00:30:35,679
You bunch of young nobles can't even

612
00:30:35,679 --> 00:30:37,080
handle an orphaned girl.

613
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:38,560
Shame on you!

614
00:30:38,679 --> 00:30:39,360
Brother,

615
00:30:39,959 --> 00:30:41,959
our family owns each and every grain of sand here.

616
00:30:42,279 --> 00:30:43,279
Are we going to stand by and

617
00:30:43,279 --> 00:30:44,519
let that orphan ride over Mei'er?

618
00:30:44,679 --> 00:30:45,679
We cannot swallow this!

619
00:30:45,679 --> 00:30:46,759
We can't swallow it, Uncle!

620
00:30:46,759 --> 00:30:47,880
Alright, alright.

621
00:30:48,959 --> 00:30:49,679
Uncle has

622
00:30:49,679 --> 00:30:51,320
sent men to arrest her ages ago.

623
00:30:51,679 --> 00:30:52,959
Isn't crushing an orphan girl

624
00:30:52,999 --> 00:30:54,519
easier than squashing an ant?

625
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:56,479
Now go on, thank your uncle!

626
00:30:56,479 --> 00:30:58,560
Thank you, Uncle!

627
00:30:58,679 --> 00:31:00,640
Uncle just got a new little treasure.

628
00:31:00,919 --> 00:31:01,560
Take it.

629
00:31:01,679 --> 00:31:02,439
Thanks, Uncle!

630
00:31:02,479 --> 00:31:03,360
I'll be going now!

631
00:31:03,519 --> 00:31:03,919
Go on.

632
00:31:03,919 --> 00:31:04,800
Thanks, Brother!

633
00:31:05,279 --> 00:31:06,080
Off you go!

634
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:11,719
That niece of mine?

635
00:31:11,880 --> 00:31:12,880
I've spoiled her rotten.

636
00:31:12,880 --> 00:31:13,640
Magistrate Wang,

637
00:31:14,199 --> 00:31:15,840
take Mr. Hal to collect

638
00:31:15,840 --> 00:31:17,400
the travel pass for Nethereach.

639
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:18,320
Yes.

640
00:31:19,239 --> 00:31:20,519
Thank you, Governor Ding.

641
00:31:21,279 --> 00:31:23,320
Sir, this way, please.

642
00:31:25,239 --> 00:31:25,999
Stop right there.

643
00:31:32,880 --> 00:31:33,719
Mr. Hal.

644
00:31:34,040 --> 00:31:34,919
Don't forget.

645
00:31:35,120 --> 00:31:38,040
This is how much you pay monthly.

646
00:31:38,360 --> 00:31:39,519
Short one coin,

647
00:31:39,800 --> 00:31:42,800
and the wild dogs of Shazhou are ravenous.

648
00:31:54,040 --> 00:31:55,199
That rat Ding Chong

649
00:31:55,560 --> 00:31:56,519
isn't just insatiable.

650
00:31:56,519 --> 00:31:57,679
He tramples on human lives.

651
00:32:14,919 --> 00:32:16,600
Did you know that prisoner, sir?

652
00:32:17,999 --> 00:32:19,400
We must reel in the catch tomorrow.

653
00:32:19,999 --> 00:32:20,479
Yes.

654
00:32:23,719 --> 00:32:25,400
Here is the deed to the farm under my name.

655
00:32:25,439 --> 00:32:26,400
Pawn it with the rest

656
00:32:26,400 --> 00:32:27,239
to buy Tinghui's freedom.

657
00:32:29,840 --> 00:32:30,959
Here, take this too.

658
00:32:31,120 --> 00:32:31,759
Miss!

659
00:32:31,759 --> 00:32:32,679
This is the last bit of dowry

660
00:32:32,679 --> 00:32:33,600
your mother left you.

661
00:32:33,800 --> 00:32:35,239
Tinghui is in trouble because of me.

662
00:32:35,279 --> 00:32:36,360
How can I turn a blind eye?

663
00:32:36,360 --> 00:32:37,439
If Mother were still here,

664
00:32:37,439 --> 00:32:38,279
she'd countenance

665
00:32:38,279 --> 00:32:39,160
my last resort.

666
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:40,560
All Ding Chong wants is money, isn't it?

667
00:32:41,479 --> 00:32:42,120
I'll give it to him.

668
00:32:42,439 --> 00:32:43,080
Careful.

669
00:32:43,679 --> 00:32:43,999
Go, hustle.

670
00:32:43,999 --> 00:32:44,519
Yes.

671
00:32:46,400 --> 00:32:47,820
- Where do you think you're going?
- My lady!

672
00:32:48,199 --> 00:32:48,880
Keep your hands

673
00:32:48,880 --> 00:32:50,239
off the Yan family's property.

674
00:32:52,239 --> 00:32:53,840
This is the dowry my mother left me.

675
00:32:53,999 --> 00:32:54,919
If anything, it is mine.

676
00:32:54,919 --> 00:32:55,919
Yan Fuzhi!

677
00:32:56,840 --> 00:32:58,040
Every single thing

678
00:32:58,080 --> 00:32:58,999
under this roof

679
00:32:58,999 --> 00:33:00,999
was earned by your father.

680
00:33:01,199 --> 00:33:02,040
And you are here

681
00:33:02,479 --> 00:33:03,860
trying to bite the hand that feeds you.

682
00:33:04,600 --> 00:33:05,519
Ungrateful brat!

683
00:33:05,600 --> 00:33:07,199
Stay away from her.

684
00:33:07,199 --> 00:33:08,160
I'll beat you to death!

685
00:33:08,160 --> 00:33:10,199
Don't you bully my mother!

686
00:33:13,640 --> 00:33:16,040
Mama! Mama!

687
00:33:16,320 --> 00:33:18,880
There, there, Song'er. Don't cry.

688
00:33:19,160 --> 00:33:20,080
We'll have Daddy

689
00:33:20,080 --> 00:33:21,239
buy you a new one tomorrow.

690
00:33:22,519 --> 00:33:23,300
He needs his father.

691
00:33:23,300 --> 00:33:23,840
Yes.

692
00:33:26,320 --> 00:33:27,640
You crossed Ding Chong,

693
00:33:27,999 --> 00:33:29,160
and got the wine house sealed.

694
00:33:29,360 --> 00:33:30,560
Do you know how much silver

695
00:33:30,560 --> 00:33:31,719
your father had to bribe him with

696
00:33:31,719 --> 00:33:32,919
to smooth things over?

697
00:33:32,919 --> 00:33:33,439
Let's go.

698
00:33:33,560 --> 00:33:34,400
Stop her!

699
00:33:35,840 --> 00:33:36,519
Get out of my way!

700
00:33:37,759 --> 00:33:38,479
Out of my way!

701
00:33:38,479 --> 00:33:39,679
Let go of Miss!

702
00:33:41,640 --> 00:33:42,759
Grow up and think.

703
00:33:42,759 --> 00:33:44,959
Why would your father cross Ding

704
00:33:45,160 --> 00:33:47,199
for the sake of that friend of yours?

705
00:33:48,160 --> 00:33:49,080
He's already

706
00:33:49,080 --> 00:33:50,439
arranged a fine marriage for you.

707
00:33:50,519 --> 00:33:52,360
Be a good girl and prepare to wed.

708
00:33:54,519 --> 00:33:55,239
Let go of me!

709
00:33:55,320 --> 00:33:55,759
I wonder

710
00:33:55,759 --> 00:33:56,999
what kind of spell

711
00:33:56,999 --> 00:33:58,540
that unwanted girl has cast on you.

712
00:33:58,880 --> 00:33:59,840
She looked young

713
00:33:59,840 --> 00:34:01,400
yet was vicious enough to take on my son.

714
00:34:01,880 --> 00:34:03,320
Nearly took your brother's life...

715
00:34:03,320 --> 00:34:04,439
I have no brother!

716
00:34:07,600 --> 00:34:08,519
He never even cared to

717
00:34:08,519 --> 00:34:09,800
sit through my mother's first week rites

718
00:34:10,120 --> 00:34:11,640
to have you waltzing right in.

719
00:34:12,199 --> 00:34:13,120
It was Tinghui who

720
00:34:13,800 --> 00:34:14,320
got me through

721
00:34:14,320 --> 00:34:15,600
those unbearable days.

722
00:34:16,080 --> 00:34:18,080
I must get Tinghui out.

723
00:34:18,799 --> 00:34:20,960
I'm not ruining her chance for the imperial exam.

724
00:34:21,480 --> 00:34:22,120
Let me go!

725
00:34:22,120 --> 00:34:24,040
To bad she crossed Ding Chong.

726
00:34:24,120 --> 00:34:24,640
There's

727
00:34:24,640 --> 00:34:26,239
no way she can make it out of prison alive.

728
00:34:26,640 --> 00:34:28,080
Go ahead and kiss her goodbye.

729
00:34:31,879 --> 00:34:32,759
Wait.

730
00:34:39,879 --> 00:34:41,399
You've been wanting to marry me off

731
00:34:41,640 --> 00:34:42,879
so you can have it all to yourself.

732
00:34:44,160 --> 00:34:45,839
Well, if you agree to rescue Tinghui,

733
00:34:46,759 --> 00:34:47,719
I will

734
00:34:48,440 --> 00:34:49,679
put on the bridal gown,

735
00:34:51,239 --> 00:34:52,839
and never speak of business again.

736
00:34:53,679 --> 00:34:55,640
Now you've come to your senses?

737
00:34:57,279 --> 00:34:58,239
Too late.

738
00:34:58,319 --> 00:34:58,960
Let's get out.

739
00:35:00,120 --> 00:35:00,759
Miss!

740
00:35:01,160 --> 00:35:02,040
Miss!

741
00:35:05,719 --> 00:35:06,920
Let me out!

742
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:08,799
Let me out!

743
00:35:08,799 --> 00:35:10,399
Tinghui needs to take the Provincial Exam.

744
00:35:10,399 --> 00:35:12,120
She can't be stuck in this cell!

745
00:35:15,399 --> 00:35:17,399
She can't be stuck in here!

746
00:35:40,719 --> 00:35:42,640
Bet big, and out comes one-two-three.

747
00:35:42,640 --> 00:35:44,440
Bet small, and it's triple six.

748
00:35:44,799 --> 00:35:47,679
This is cursed. Absolutely cursed.

749
00:35:49,160 --> 00:35:49,679
Drink up!

750
00:35:49,759 --> 00:35:50,359
Come on.

751
00:35:51,359 --> 00:35:51,960
Cheers.

752
00:35:55,359 --> 00:35:56,120
Buddy,

753
00:35:56,640 --> 00:35:57,799
let's swap seats.

754
00:35:58,239 --> 00:35:59,319
Your spot has better luck.

755
00:35:59,319 --> 00:35:59,839
Hold on.

756
00:36:11,640 --> 00:36:12,279
Come here.

757
00:36:15,960 --> 00:36:18,000
Orders from above say no food or water for him.

758
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:19,040
And now look at this.

759
00:36:19,120 --> 00:36:20,359
We're making offerings.

760
00:36:20,520 --> 00:36:21,759
Let's just stop playing.

761
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:23,879
Nobody's leaving. We keep playing.

762
00:36:30,239 --> 00:36:31,319
I've heard, in the cell,

763
00:36:31,319 --> 00:36:33,040
inmates die "unexpectedly" all the time.

764
00:36:33,319 --> 00:36:34,239
Meng Tinghui

765
00:36:34,239 --> 00:36:35,600
fell right into my hands.

766
00:36:35,679 --> 00:36:37,040
Can't wait to see how terribly she's suffered.

767
00:36:41,920 --> 00:36:43,560
Stop dawdling!

768
00:36:43,759 --> 00:36:44,640
You deserved a slap.

769
00:36:47,199 --> 00:36:47,879
Cheers.

770
00:36:52,279 --> 00:36:53,160
Buddy,

771
00:36:53,719 --> 00:36:54,640
you're practically

772
00:36:55,120 --> 00:36:56,719
top-tier in Shazhou

773
00:36:56,960 --> 00:36:58,399
when it comes to gambling.

774
00:37:02,120 --> 00:37:03,000
Top-tier!

775
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:04,239
Impressive!

776
00:37:05,960 --> 00:37:07,160
If you just spar with me

777
00:37:08,319 --> 00:37:09,679
for a couple of days,

778
00:37:09,839 --> 00:37:12,759
your skills will soar.

779
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:14,839
Meng Tinghui?

780
00:37:29,319 --> 00:37:30,239
Meng Tinghui!

781
00:37:30,520 --> 00:37:32,199
Let's see how high and mighty you are now.

782
00:37:35,319 --> 00:37:36,960
Forget about being saved.

783
00:37:37,319 --> 00:37:38,120
Yan Fuzhi just

784
00:37:38,120 --> 00:37:39,640
got herself into a huge trouble.

785
00:37:40,520 --> 00:37:41,759
Bofeng House is sealed.

786
00:37:42,239 --> 00:37:44,040
The poor bride-to-be has been confined at home.

787
00:37:44,040 --> 00:37:45,480
The bridal gown is all set.

788
00:37:45,480 --> 00:37:46,440
News of the marriage

789
00:37:46,440 --> 00:37:47,839
has been all over Shazhou.

790
00:37:48,839 --> 00:37:49,960
Dying to get out and

791
00:37:49,960 --> 00:37:51,319
come to her rescue again?

792
00:37:51,719 --> 00:37:52,759
Such a shame.

793
00:37:52,960 --> 00:37:54,199
The odds are against you.

794
00:37:56,199 --> 00:37:58,359
I'll see to it that you rot here for the rest of your life,

795
00:37:58,679 --> 00:38:00,600
until you beg me for ending you.

796
00:38:05,080 --> 00:38:06,319
Here, take a look.

797
00:38:07,359 --> 00:38:08,679
After all this back and forth,

798
00:38:09,120 --> 00:38:10,440
your entry writ

799
00:38:10,440 --> 00:38:12,279
ends up in my hands.

800
00:38:12,279 --> 00:38:13,480
Give that back to me!

801
00:38:14,440 --> 00:38:16,160
You want to be an official so badly, huh?

802
00:38:17,080 --> 00:38:17,799
I suppose so.

803
00:38:18,480 --> 00:38:20,759
With your lowly background,

804
00:38:20,759 --> 00:38:21,440
there really is no

805
00:38:21,440 --> 00:38:23,199
other way out, except the exam, is there?

806
00:38:23,839 --> 00:38:25,399
My situation is quite different, though.

807
00:38:25,759 --> 00:38:27,319
The patron behind my uncle

808
00:38:27,359 --> 00:38:28,719
is none other than

809
00:38:28,719 --> 00:38:31,080
the Grand Chancellor, second only to the throne.

810
00:38:32,040 --> 00:38:33,279
Above every patron,

811
00:38:33,839 --> 00:38:35,160
there is still the law.

812
00:38:35,960 --> 00:38:38,120
If the court learns of your crimes,

813
00:38:39,199 --> 00:38:41,520
they will uproot your rotten household

814
00:38:42,319 --> 00:38:43,560
along with that patron of yours.

815
00:38:48,120 --> 00:38:48,799
Stop!

816
00:38:49,799 --> 00:38:50,560
Stop it!

817
00:38:52,199 --> 00:38:53,199
Stop it!

818
00:38:56,359 --> 00:38:57,239
Meng Tinghui.

819
00:38:57,640 --> 00:38:58,960
Everything you cherished

820
00:38:58,960 --> 00:39:01,040
won't be able to survive a flick of my hand.

821
00:39:01,080 --> 00:39:02,560
Your entry writ is shredded to pieces.

822
00:39:03,040 --> 00:39:03,879
You can spend

823
00:39:03,879 --> 00:39:05,960
the rest of your life dreaming of an exam hall.

824
00:39:07,960 --> 00:39:09,640
Mark my words:

825
00:39:10,359 --> 00:39:12,160
As long as my uncle is around,

826
00:39:12,719 --> 00:39:14,640
you and Yan Fuzhi

827
00:39:15,120 --> 00:39:17,839
will never see the day you rise again.

828
00:39:23,040 --> 00:39:24,359
Meng Tinghui!

829
00:39:24,560 --> 00:39:25,600
Xia, now!

830
00:39:25,719 --> 00:39:26,600
Release the vipers!

831
00:39:36,279 --> 00:39:36,960
Xia!

832
00:39:37,839 --> 00:39:39,520
Meng Tinghui, just you wait!

833
00:39:39,759 --> 00:39:41,120
I'll be here to torment you every single day.

834
00:39:41,279 --> 00:39:43,040
I'll make your life a living hell.

835
00:40:22,560 --> 00:40:23,239
Remember.

836
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:25,560
A top-notch pickpocket takes money swift and clean.

837
00:40:26,080 --> 00:40:27,399
There can be no red mark.

838
00:40:28,319 --> 00:40:28,920
You try.

839
00:40:44,319 --> 00:40:45,239
Tinghui!

840
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:47,440
Let's go.

841
00:41:02,839 --> 00:41:03,920
Tinghui!

842
00:42:15,199 --> 00:42:16,879
Guards! Someone's escaped!

843
00:42:18,920 --> 00:42:19,920
Someone's escaped!

844
00:42:19,960 --> 00:42:21,199
A prisoner has broken out!

845
00:42:21,679 --> 00:42:22,920
A prisoner has escaped!

846
00:42:25,480 --> 00:42:26,640
Who? Who escaped?

847
00:42:26,640 --> 00:42:28,359
Meng Tinghui! It's Meng Tinghui!

848
00:42:28,600 --> 00:42:29,480
Meng Tinghui?

849
00:42:29,759 --> 00:42:30,520
Split up from here.

850
00:42:30,520 --> 00:42:31,120
Alright.

851
00:42:32,679 --> 00:42:33,520
Move, move!

852
00:42:34,279 --> 00:42:35,120
Out of the way.

853
00:42:35,520 --> 00:42:36,239
Move!

854
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:37,640
Move aside! Move!

855
00:42:40,359 --> 00:42:40,960
Prisoner at large.

856
00:42:40,960 --> 00:42:42,120
